{"4280520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "InSector", "steam_appid": 4280520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5163900], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280520/extras/1e64b621d6dea62ab2c3a436a50781d6.avif?t=1788183684\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280520/extras_big/1e64b621d6dea62ab2c3a436a50781d6.avif?t=1788183684 width=1560 height=842 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >InSector is a story-driven RPG with elements of strategy and tactics set in a sci-fi setting of the distant future, where intergalactic travel has become the norm and the evolution of the human brain has unlocked abilities indistinguishable from magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player finds themselves on a hostile planet after a research vessel carrying out a classified mission crashes. The disaster destroys the colony's protective dome, letting in a toxic fog and aggressive fauna. To survive, uncover the secret of the mission, and understand the cause of the crash, the player must explore the planet, gather survivors, manage a squad in real time, and solve problems using a variety of methods: assault, sabotage, stealth infiltration, or clever tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pleasant graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base building</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruiting units</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming, crafting, character progression</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles, fortress assaults</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing quests in different ways</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280520/extras/1e64b621d6dea62ab2c3a436a50781d6.avif?t=1788183684\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280520/extras_big/1e64b621d6dea62ab2c3a436a50781d6.avif?t=1788183684 width=1560 height=842 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >InSector is a story-driven RPG with elements of strategy and tactics set in a sci-fi setting of the distant future, where intergalactic travel has become the norm and the evolution of the human brain has unlocked abilities indistinguishable from magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player finds themselves on a hostile planet after a research vessel carrying out a classified mission crashes. The disaster destroys the colony's protective dome, letting in a toxic fog and aggressive fauna. To survive, uncover the secret of the mission, and understand the cause of the crash, the player must explore the planet, gather survivors, manage a squad in real time, and solve problems using a variety of methods: assault, sabotage, stealth infiltration, or clever tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pleasant graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base building</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruiting units</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming, crafting, character progression</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles, fortress assaults</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing quests in different ways</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "InSector is a third-person, story-driven RPG with instant strategy and full combat control. Develop your base, recruit troops, upgrade your hero, storm fortresses or infiltrate them secretly, and use weapons, technology, and your mind to uncover the mystery and decide the fate of the colony.", "supported_languages": "Russian<strong>*</strong>, English<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280520/0b98bebceb909b98475c40b71a8b9b1471c333c5/header.jpg?t=1788183684", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280520/c1194da1c5e726268b99603af3c049bb761a496f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788183684", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4280520/c1194da1c5e726268b99603af3c049bb761a496f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788183684", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 (6 GB) / AMD RX 590 (8 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15000 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> 16-bit Sound Card</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12600K / AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060 Ti (8 GB) / RTX 4060 (8 GB) / AMD RX 6700 XT (12 GB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15000 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Sound Blaster® X-FiTM series Sound Card</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Darum Games"], "p